---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About | CaveExplorer">
  <main>
    <h1>About CaveExplorer</h1>

    <section class="about-content">
      <p>
        CaveExplorer is a multi-language demonstration project that models cave systems
        and underground exploration using four different technologies: Java, C#, TypeScript,
        and Angular.
      </p>
      <p>
        Each language tackles a different aspect of speleology — from graph-based
        cave traversal in Java, to geological modeling in C#, type-safe mapping in
        TypeScript, and interactive dashboards in Angular.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="tech-stack">
      <h2>Technology Stack</h2>
      <div class="tech-grid">
        <div class="tech-item">
          <h3>Java</h3>
          <p>Graph algorithms, BFS/DFS traversal, cave pathfinding, and exploration simulation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-item">
          <h3>C#</h3>
          <p>Object-oriented cave system modeling with chambers, passages, and geological formations.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-item">
          <h3>TypeScript</h3>
          <p>Type-safe cave mapping with coordinate geometry, distance calculations, and data models.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-item">
          <h3>Angular</h3>
          <p>Component-based dashboard for cave exploration data, stats, and real-time monitoring.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="facts">
      <h2>Cave Facts</h2>
      <ul class="fact-list">
        <li>The deepest known cave is Veryovkina Cave in Georgia at 2,212 meters.</li>
        <li>Mammoth Cave in Kentucky is the world's longest known cave system at over 680 km.</li>
        <li>Cave formations called speleothems can take thousands of years to form.</li>
        <li>Over 17,000 species of animals are known to live exclusively in caves.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  main {
    max-width: 750px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 2rem 0 1.5rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
    color: #d4a574;
  }

  .about-content p {
    color: #9ca3af;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .tech-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .tech-item {
    background: #0f0f18;
    border: 1px solid #1e1e2e;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }

  .tech-item h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
    color: #f0f0f0;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .tech-item p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #9ca3af;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .fact-list {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    color: #9ca3af;
    line-height: 1.8;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .fact-list li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .tech-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
